Add per-note MIDI polyphonic aftertouch (0xA0) as a square-law note level for Shine On.
Routes 0xA0 through the note event ring per part, applies square-law gain to matching
(part, note) keyers' block amplitude (skipping when level is 127 for bit-identical unity),
keeps the level per held/latched key (including arp octave steps), and resets on note-on
and all-notes-off/panic.

